1
00:00:00,703 --> 00:00:02,133
(Leonard(on screen):)I can't help but remember

2
00:00:02,138 --> 00:00:04,208
(Leonard(on screen):)the last time
I was in this auditorium.

3
00:00:04,206 --> 00:00:05,636
(Leonard(on screen):)Two guys from the lacrosse team

4
00:00:05,641 --> 00:00:09,111
(Leonard(on screen):)played keep-away
with my asthma inhaler.

5
00:00:09,111 --> 00:00:12,581
(Leonard(on screen):)But enough about
my ten-year reunion.

6
00:00:12,581 --> 00:00:15,211
(Leonard(on screen):)I'd also like
to take a moment

7
00:00:15,217 --> 00:00:17,217
(Leonard(on screen):)to thank
my beautiful fiancée

8
00:00:17,219 --> 00:00:18,719
(Leonard(on screen):)for to helping make
this speech possible,

9
00:00:18,721 --> 00:00:20,651
(Leonard(on screen):)even though weather
nearly prevented it.

10
00:00:20,656 --> 00:00:23,256
(Penny:)Oh. Hello.

11
00:00:23,259 --> 00:00:25,129
I-I didn't know
he was gonna point it at me,

12
00:00:25,127 --> 00:00:28,097
(Penny:)so... don't do drugs
and stay in school.

13
00:00:28,097 --> 00:00:28,927
(Leonard:)They're graduating.

14
00:00:28,931 --> 00:00:30,231
Okay, bye!

15
00:00:32,834 --> 00:00:35,134
(Howard:)All right, the power
supply is reconnected.

16
00:00:35,137 --> 00:00:36,407
(Howard:)I think we're
back in business.

17
00:00:36,405 --> 00:00:39,335
(Howard:)Let's just run a few tests
before we take it outside.

18
00:00:39,341 --> 00:00:40,941
(Howard:)Sheldon, we got WiFi?
Check.

19
00:00:40,943 --> 00:00:42,143
(Howard:)GPS?
Check.

20
00:00:42,144 --> 00:00:43,814
(Howard:)Battery charged?
Check.

21
00:00:43,813 --> 00:00:47,283
(Bernadette:)Four hours of our lives gone?
Check.

22
00:00:47,283 --> 00:00:48,453
(Sheldon:)All right.

23
00:00:48,450 --> 00:00:49,680
(Howard:)All systems go.

24
00:00:49,685 --> 00:00:50,685
(Howard:)In five...

25
00:00:50,686 --> 00:00:53,456
(Together:)...four, three, two, one.

26
00:00:53,455 --> 00:00:59,025
(electrical crackle)

